
          SiL-WALL v2.32, Written By The Silencer / TRSi in 1994
          ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯

                 Release date: Sumwhere inbetween 1994-95


    This is a simple WALL door which should be run when a user logs in
    using the MCI Launch Door command ~CC_<DOORNAME>| for example in
    the BBS:Bull.txt.. This version is fully functional but is far from
    finished. I'm planning to include many new features in this door
    and make it fully configurable.. As it is now the paths the door is
    using is hardcoded into the door, that's why you must create and put
    the door in this path "DOORS:Wall/"........




                            Files in this package:

             SiLWall.000    (680x0  version)       20280 bytes
             SiLWall.020    (68020+ version)       20280 bytes
             SiLWALL.DOC    (What you are reading)  1518 bytes
             SiLWALL.info   (Tooltypes)             1068 bytes
             SiLWall.iff    (What it looks like)    9088 bytes

     NOTE. The 000/020+ Versions have the same size in bytes yeah but
           don't be fooled coz the 020+ Version crashes some 68000
           based systems so use the one compatible with your processor!
           The 680x0 Version is for Any amiga, be it 68000/20/30/40.
           The 68020 version is identical to the 030 compiled version
           so if you have a 030 use the 020+ version...



